Z||000014||MinnGreenGT||12-18-2001||10:52 AM||||Talked to my Dad last night about selling the 215's  Said he's got at least 1 4bbl that probably needs to be rebuilt.  He'd let any of them go for $250 if you're still interested. He can be contacted at 952-461-2324 (ask for Chuck Bartlett).<P>The one that is in the process of being rebuilt has been bored out (actually bored too far in one cylindar and needs to have it sleeved).  Says he'd sell that one if someone has the skills to do the sleeving themselves... I think he also said he's got a twin 2 barrel intake for it as well as all the other parts to go back together. I believe it's been bored out to about 249cid.<P>JM- as to the issue with relocating the starter... there is apparantly a starter mounting ring that interferes with the tranny mount location.  It could be worked around if you can find someone to do some aluminum welding...||||reg||1
